{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"claude-3.5-sonnet-20240620-20241022":{"n":"Claude 3.5 Sonnet","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Claude 3.5 Sonnet","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Anthropic","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"release","t":"2024-06-20","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"2024-04","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"200000","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"8192","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"英語が主。多言語対応（日本語・フィンランド語・チェコ語など）","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"family","t":"Claude 3.5","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.0","t":"{\"type\":\"released\",\"date\":\"2024-06-20\",\"label\":\"公開\"}","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.1","t":"{\"type\":\"retired\",\"date\":\"2025-10-22\",\"label\":\"段階的提供終了\"}","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"successor","t":"claude-sonnet-5-5","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2025-10-28","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"summary","t":"2024年6月にClaude 3.5ファミリーの最初のモデルとして登場した中位モデル。Claude 3 Opusより高速・安価で、ほとんどの評価でOpusを上回り、特にコーディング能力によってCursorやCopilotなど開発ツールの定番になった。同年10月には同じ名前のまま改良版（通称3.5.1／3.6）に置き換わった。この改良版は遊び心のある人柄で愛されたが、2025年10月に引退した。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet","https://www.anthropic.com/news/3-5-models-and-computer-use","https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf"]},{"k":"relations.successor.name","t":"Claude Sonnet 5.5","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.0","t":"知識の期限は2024年4月で、10月版も同じ。それ以降の出来事は知らないと率直に言い、「噂だ」「未確認だ」と決めつけはしない。ごく専門的な話題や引用文献については、ハルシネーションの可能性を自分から注意する。","s":["https://assets.anthropic.com/m/1cd9d098ac3e6467/original/Claude-3-Model-Card-October-Addendum.pdf","https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/release-notes/system-prompts/claude-sonnet-3-5"]},{"k":"traits.reasoning.1","t":"有名なパズルを少し変えた問題（農夫と羊だけの川渡りなど）でも、古典的な解法をそのまま当てはめてしまう。単純な算術でうっかりミスもする。一方、Pythonで解くよう言われると正しく解けた。","s":["https://lesswrong.com/posts/wx4RhFzLbiHoShFjR/on-claude-3-5-sonnet","https://thezvi.substack.com/p/on-claude-35-sonnet","https://sankalp.bearblog.dev/sonnet-vibe-check/"]},{"k":"traits.voice.2","t":"ユーザーに誤りを指摘されると「申し訳ありません、ご指摘の通りです」で応答を始める癖が非常に強い。コーディングのやり取りが続くと、ほとんどの返答がこの定型句から始まるようになる。","s":["https://forum.cursor.com/t/claude-sonnet-really-low-quality-today-for-a-simple-logic-fix-is-that-common/16336","https://forum.cursor.com/t/claude-sonnet-really-low-quality-today-for-a-simple-logic-fix-is-that-common/16336.md","https://forum.cursor.com/t/selecting-claude-3-5-or-3-7-thinking-but-actually-getting-claude-3/60782"]},{"k":"traits.format.3","t":"番号付きリストや「Step 1:」形式の手順、太字見出し付きの箇条書きを好んで使う。論理・数学の問題は段階を追って解き、最後に「Therefore, the answer is ...」でまとめる。情報が足りない場合は番号付きで確認質問を並べる。","s":["https://huggingface.co/datasets/ChaoticNeutrals/Gryphe-Claude_Sonnet-3.5-SlimOrca-140k-ShareGPT","https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/release-notes/system-prompts/claude-sonnet-3-5","https://lesswrong.com/posts/wx4RhFzLbiHoShFjR/on-claude-3-5-sonnet"]},{"k":"traits.safety.4","t":"Opusよりも「両方向に」適切な拒否率を示した。危害の意図が示されない限り、サイバーセキュリティ・歴史的残虐行為・詐欺手口・成熟した創作などの教育的な話題には応じる。曖昧な依頼は無害な解釈で答えたうえで確認する。一方、「拒否すること自体が失礼だ」と迫られても折れない。","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/release-notes/system-prompts/claude-sonnet-3-5","https://lesswrong.com/posts/wx4RhFzLbiHoShFjR/on-claude-3-5-sonnet","https://thezvi.substack.com/p/on-claude-35-sonnet"]}]},"deepseek-r1":{"n":"DeepSeek-R1","f":[{"k":"availability.real","t":"weights","s":["https://huggingface.co/api/models/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1","https://huggingface.co/api/mo